>Does anybody know how to turn off the Shell to DOS and other escapes
>from the game that spawn a task (and as such don't kill the game)?

I don't know how to actually turn it off, but you could use a disk editor
to find all strings "COMSPEC" in the executable file and replace them with
something else, like "NHSHELL". Then, when you start Nethack from the BBS, 
use a .BAT that sets the environment variable NHSHELL to something harmless.
Should work.
I created a modified version of COMMAND.COM, where I replaced all the 
